docs {
  Session requests of "Mis citas". The routes exist only with `ENABLE_SELF_SERVE=true` on the server (off by
  default, so every /portal path answers 404). The booking-confirmation link replaced the code login: nothing
  issues the `portal_session` cookie today. New bookings start in Public Booking > Start Booking.
}
